  "conformsTo": "http:\/\/mlcommons.org\/croissant\/1.1",
  "name": "histor-mcp-tool-definitions",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tHISTOR snapshot 2026-11-09: what MCP servers advertise, and when it changes\n\t\n\nHISTOR reads the tool list (tools\/list) of every remote MCP server in the official MCP registry\non a polling schedule, and of npm\/PyPI MCP packages run in a sandbox once per published version (new versions\nfirst, a few hundred a day). It records the exact tool definitions,\npins them by digest, and writes a signed label to a public RFC 9162 Merkle log whenever a tool set\nfirst appears, stays the same, or… See the full description on the dataset page: https:\/\/huggingface.co\/datasets\/alexar76\/histor-mcp-tool-definitions.",
  "alternateName": [
    "alexar76\/histor-mcp-tool-definitions",
    "HISTOR — MCP tool definitions and how they change"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Aleksandr Artamokhov",
    "url": "https:\/\/huggingface.co\/alexar76"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "text-classification",
    "multi-label-classification",
    "machine-generated",
    "monolingual",
    "original",
    "English",
    "cc-by-4.0",
    "100K - 1M",
