f, which is a SEPARATE substrate from the cross-vendor catalog: it is reached only when the cross-vendor catalog returns nothing, and its rows carry the merchant's own product data rather than datasheet-extracted golden records. Omit it for cross-vendor search, which is the default and the right choice for \\\\\\\&quot;what should I buy\\\\\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;merchant\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;pattern\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,62}$\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;merchant\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;type\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;string\\\&quot;\&quot;}]}}],\&quot;detail\&quot;:\&quot;full\&quot;,\&quot;newAddresses\&quot;:[],\&quot;newAddressesTotal\&quot;:0}&quot;}}},{&quot;rowIdx&quot;:1,&quot;cells&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;number&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:2,&quot;string&quot;:&quot;2&quot;},&quot;serverId&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;cd3b1b86444bffe2&quot;},&quot;observedAt&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2026-09-24 10:53:44&quot;},&quot;fromToolSetDigest&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;sha256-MVlxNjC9Y5OcsftdTXA6qB3nx3Itzt58tCeXKNrfvJs=&quot;},&quot;toToolSetDigest&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;sha256-vImYLKZyrlZOd74VBVk2E8SvTGOI29/gGlV2J1VScfY=&quot;},&quot;fromSubjectDigest&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;sha256-V2hKnw/bS+TWjjMIyRQzZTTSDsDn8adBU/lxWsmViJc=&quot;},&quot;toSubjectDigest&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;sha256-TAmxctgGcpZ7JuJq7G2YcKB1EZsm3siPjZ/ZJfOrpaM=&quot;},&quot;fromPackageVersion&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;null&quot;},&quot;toPackageVersion&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;null&quot;},&quot;fromServerVersion&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;1.0.6&quot;},&quot;toServerVersion&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;1.0.6&quot;},&quot;fromRegistryVersion&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;null&quot;},&quot;toRegistryVersion&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;null&quot;},&quot;labelId&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;urn:uuid:24a3a37d-2746-464b-aea0-02399ec19116&quot;},&quot;summaryJson&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;{\&quot;added\&quot;:[],\&quot;removed\&quot;:[],\&quot;modified\&quot;:[{\&quot;tool\&quot;:\&quot;find_opportunities\&quot;,\&quot;fields\&quot;:{\&quot;inputSchema\&quot;:[{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;lang\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;description\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;old\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;Reading language for the TITLE — 'EN' (default), 'FR' or 'DE'. This is a RENDERING choice, never a filter: it changes which string `title` carries, never which rows come back. Read `title_lang` on every row for the language actually served: it differs from what you asked for exactly when that translation does not exist (FR covers 1,492 of 1,588 site-radar rows, DE 1,373 — measured 2026-09-04), and the verbatim is served instead, labelled with the language the harvest chain measured. `source_lan\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;Reading language for the TITLE — 'EN' (default), 'FR' or 'DE'. This is a RENDERING choice, never a filter: it changes which string `title` carries, never which rows come back. Read `title_lang` on every row for the language actually served: it differs from what you asked for exactly when that translation does not exist (the live FR/DE coverage is counted on every response in `_meta.untranslated_leg`), and the verbatim is served instead, labelled with the language the harvest chain measured. `so\&quot;}],\&quot;outputSchema\&quot;:[{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;canonical_id\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;description\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;Set when the site folded this posting into another one it judged identical: `citation_url` is then the page of THAT posting (`canonical_id`). When both are matched, only the canonical row is served and `_meta.duplicates_folded` counts the fold. Null otherwise.\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;canonical_id\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;type\\\&quot;[0]\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;string\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;canonical_id\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;type\\\&quot;[1]\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;null\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;salary_min\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;description\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;The posting's own advertised salary, YEARLY (see `salary_period`). Null when none was published, and null when the published amount cannot be a yearly salary — `salary_withheld_reason` then says why.\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;salary_period\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;description\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;`year` when salary_min/salary_max are served. Null otherwise — never a guessed unit.\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;salary_period\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;type\\\&quot;[0]\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;string\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;salary_period\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;type\\\&quot;[1]\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;null\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;salary_withheld_reason\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;description\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;Why a published salary was NOT served: `below_annual_floor` (the low end is below any yearly salary in that currency — a monthly or daily figure filed as a salary) or `board_estimate` (the job board's own min = max estimate, not the employer's). The amount is withheld, never converted. Null when nothing was withheld.\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;salary_withheld_reason\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;type\\\&quot;[0]\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;string\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;salary_withheld_reason\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;type\\\&quot;[1]\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;null\\\&quot;\&quot;},{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;title_lang\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;description\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;old\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;ISO-639-1 language the SERVED `title` is written in. READ IT ON EVERY ROW: it is what you asked for in `lang` when that translation exists, and the advertiser's own language when it does not (FR covers 1,492 of 1,588 site-radar rows, DE 1,373 — measured 2026-09-04). Null when the harvest chain could not decide, and on every promoted-leg row, which carries no translated column at all. ⚠️ THIS FIELD CHANGED REFERENT ON 2026-09-04: until then it named the language the ADVERTISER wrote in — that fa\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;ISO-639-1 language the SERVED `title` is written in. READ IT ON EVERY ROW: it is what you asked for in `lang` when that translation exists, and the advertiser's own language when it does not (the live FR/DE coverage is counted on every response in `_meta.untranslated_leg`). Null when the harvest chain could not decide — on some site-radar rows too, counted in `_meta.untranslated_radar_rows` — and on every promoted-leg row, which carries no translated column at all. ⚠️ THIS FIELD CHANGED REFEREN\&quot;}]}},{\&quot;tool\&quot;:\&quot;query_knowledge_graph\&quot;,\&quot;fields\&quot;:{\&quot;outputSchema\&quot;:[{\&quot;path\&quot;:\&quot;$.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;rows\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;items\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;properties\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;direction\\\&quot;.\\\&quot;description\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;old\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;`out` = node_id → neighbour, `in` = neighbour → node_id. Walk rows only.\\\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;new\&quot;:\&quot;\\\&quot;`out` = node_id → neighbour, `in` = neighbour → node_id, `both` = the relation is stored in both directions (served once — see `_meta.symmetric_edges_folded`). Walk rows only.\\\&quot;\&quot;}]}}],\&quot;detail\&quot;:\&quot;full\&quot;,\&quot;newAddresses\&quot;:[],\&quot;newAddressesTotal\&quot;:0}&quot;}}},{&quot;rowIdx&quot;:2,&quot;cells&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;number&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:3,&quot;string&quot;:&quot;3&quot;},&quot;serverId&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;b38a4b0b7098bdf2&quot;},&quot;observedAt&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2026-09-24 10:53:45&quot;},&quot;fromToolSetDigest&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;sha256-5WyV9RA0KGMYL0446okDMX061gh530tzHrMUwhsnYtU=&quot;},&quot;toToolSetDigest&quot;:{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;value&