	<a id="histor-snapshot-2026-11-09-what-mcp-servers-advertise-and-when-it-changes" class="block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full" href="#histor-snapshot-2026-11-09-what-mcp-servers-advertise-and-when-it-changes" rel="nofollow">
		<span class="header-link"><svg class="text-gray-500 hover:text-black dark:hover:text-gray-200 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span>
	</a>
	<span>
		HISTOR snapshot 2026-11-09: what MCP servers advertise, and when it changes
	</span>
</h1>
<p>HISTOR reads the tool list (<code>tools/list</code>) of every remote MCP server in the official MCP registry
on a polling schedule, and of npm/PyPI MCP packages run in a sandbox once per published version (new versions
first, a few hundred a day). It records the exact tool definitions,
pins them by digest, and writes a signed label to a public RFC 9162 Merkle log whenever a tool set
first appears, stays the same, or changes. This snapshot is that record as files.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>96,101</strong> listed servers (40,887 remote endpoints, 55,214 packages), plus 7,170 delisted</li>
<li><strong>50,534</strong> with a recorded tool set; <strong>16,758</strong> changed at least once</li>
<li><strong>73,198</strong> recorded changes, 2026-09-24 to 2026-11-09</li>
<li><strong>112,557</strong> distinct tool sets (current ones and every one a change replaced)</li>
<li><strong>1,065</strong> servers with a block-tier WARDEN pattern match, <strong>19,681</strong> advise-only</li>
</ul>
<p>Live view and per-server pages: <a href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev" rel="nofollow">https://histor.modelmarket.dev</a> · code: <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/histor" rel="nofollow">https://github.com/alexar76/histor</a></p>
<h2 class="relative group flex items-baseline">
	<a id="find-your-mcp-package-in-the-live-log" class="block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full" href="#find-your-mcp-package-in-the-live-log" rel="nofollow">
		<span class="header-link"><svg class="text-gray-500 hover:text-black dark:hover:text-gray-200 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span>
	</a>
	<span>
		Find your MCP package in the live log
	</span>
</h2>
<p><a href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev/servers?from=hf-dataset" rel="nofollow">Open the HISTOR package search</a>. Enter the package name, or use
<code>npm:mongodb-mcp-server</code> or <code>pypi:ipinfo-mcp-server</code> to select a registry.
Open the matching record to see the tool definitions HISTOR observed and their
change history. The browser view works without downloading this dataset.</p>
